Description: Reproducible pipeline that regenerates every figure and table for
    the OmniPath Metabo manuscript (main text and supplementary) from the
    OmniPath database and the results of the use-case analyses. Plots are
    ggplot2 + tidyverse; the architecture diagram is a manual Inkscape
    asset vendored under figures/architecture/manual/ (fingerprint-verified
    on every rebuild); composites are assembled with patchwork, captions
    are typeset with LaTeX, and the manuscript bundle is merged with pdftk.
